        <mxCell id="g8xTU8hoocTQupo6XSeX-1" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 21px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(92, 97, 102); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Student/​Merchant 提交或编辑帖子（UC-07）时强制&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;markdown-inline-code leading-[1.4]&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.4; background-color: color(srgb 0.785953 0.792508 0.8 / 0.420392); border-radius: 4px; color: inherit; font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace, Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; padding: 1.5px 3px; transition: 0.1s; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; word-break: break-all; cursor: default;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(92, 97, 102); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;调用 UC-08 自动翻译引擎，生成中/英文双语副本；帖子详情（UC-11）、每日简报（UC-09），还是评论（UC-12），都会通过&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;markdown-inline-code leading-[1.4]&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.4; background-color: color(srgb 0.785953 0.792508 0.8 / 0.420392); border-radius: 4px; color: inherit; font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace, Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; padding: 1.5px 3px; transition: 0.1s; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; word-break: break-all; cursor: default;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(92, 97, 102); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;复用 UC-08 的译文。UC-10 界面语言切换对阅读场景&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;markdown-inline-code leading-[1.4]&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.4; background-color: color(srgb 0.785953 0.792508 0.8 / 0.420392); border-radius: 4px; color: inherit; font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace, Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; padding: 1.5px 3px; transition: 0.1s; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; word-break: break-all; cursor: default;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;extend&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(92, 97, 102); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;作用，用户可在中/英文视图间切换，系统按所选语言展示对应的翻译内容，实现“发布即双语、阅读可切换、评论也双向”的全链路跨语言体验。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
